diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b5fe1b2a4feac926b16f4b55fd72f2bb6eb7b711..21762ee4cd8463f5b02d247a3b78e715ad5e2905 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -3,3 +3,32 @@
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental module
+
+`createRentalService()` (exported from `src/index.ts`) keeps equipment, quotes and bookings in memory:
+
+```ts
+import { createRentalService } from './src/index.ts';
+
+const desk = createRentalService();
+
+desk.addEquipment({ id: 'board-1', kind: 'board', dailyPrice: 2500 }); // cents
+
+const quote = desk.quote({
+  itemId: 'board-1',
+  start: '2024-06-01T00:00:00.000Z',
+  end: '2024-06-03T00:00:00.000Z',
+});
+// => { itemId: 'board-1', start: '2024-06-01T00:00:00.000Z', end: '2024-06-03T00:00:00.000Z', total: 5000 }
+
+const booking = desk.book(quote);
+// => { id: '1', itemId: 'board-1', start: ..., end: ..., total: 5000 }
+```
+
+Rules: prices are integer euro cents; times are UTC ISO-8601 strings; a booking covers whole days,
+from midnight to midnight; the same item cannot be booked twice for overlapping periods. `quote` and
+`book` throw for an unknown item or a disallowed period, and `book` also throws when the item is
+already booked for part of the period.
+
+Cancellation is not implemented yet.
